  * the MIT License (LICENSE.MIT).

For modifications to files containing Imported Baseline material, the
MIT option applies only to the post-baseline contribution for which
Shitty contributors can grant those rights.  The underlying Imported
Baseline remains GPL-licensed.

Combined and third-party material
---------------------------------

While the project contains GPL-only Imported Baseline material, the
combined work remains subject to the GPL when distributed as a whole.
Third-party and vendored material remains governed by its own license
notices.

An MIT notice at the top of a first-party source file marks the Shitty
contribution layer.  A retained GPL notice marks the imported layer.
